u the greatest centipede exterminator ever?  Only one way to find out; grab a Light Cannon and get out there!\n\nYou are the Wonder Kid...", "short_description": "Aliens are attacking using some of our much loved classic video games as their weapon of choice.  Grab a light cannon and fend off wave after wave of centipedes, as you prove you have what it takes to defend us.  Compete against the world as you try to put the highest score on the scoreboard.\n\nPlaying this game will make you feel like you've stepped inside a video game, or perhaps even a movie."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.ardooly.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ardooly", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ardooly.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "ACTION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "233746908952733"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5627701973911244", "version": "1.4"}, "id": "4813686315319191", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5129239140424199", 